  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are a lot of avatars I don't like, ranging from NSFW and things that make me uncomfortable to loud obnoxious avatars with loads of effects and particles. It would be cool if you could click on someone and have an option in the menu to 'Hide Specific Avatar', so if I find somebody with the same avatar, it's immediately hidden and I don't need to turn it off every time it's used. I have trauma and there are a lot of avatars that trigger bad memories, so being able to automatically hide the stuff I don't like would be really useful.",
